Package: potentiomap
Title: Build Potentiometric Surfaces and Flow Arrows
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Elvin", "Cordero", email = "elvin.cordero@seamountgeo.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Elvin Cordero [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Elvin Cordero <elvin.cordero@seamountgeo.com>
Description: Builds potentiometric surface products from groundwater monitoring
    data. The package prepares groundwater elevation observations from direct
    water-level measurements or depth-to-water data paired with land-surface
    elevations, interpolates thin-plate spline surfaces by default, supports
    alternative and user-supplied interpolation methods, exports raster and
    contour products, and derives hydraulic-gradient flow arrows.
